
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Withdrawal Details — LuxMind SIS</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f4f7fb;
      color: #172033;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .topbar {
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf1;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #079669;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }

    .dashboard-btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #344054;
      border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 650;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .dashboard-btn:hover {
      background: #f0fdf7;
      border-color: #10b981;
      color: #047857;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 94%);
      margin: 25px auto 45px;
    }

    .page-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .page-heading h1 {
      font-size: 25px;
      letter-spacing: -.7px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .muted {
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .3px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-submitted,
    .status-advisor_review,
    .status-hod_review,
    .status-finance_review,
    .status-registrar_review {
      background: #fff7e6;
      color: #a15c00;
    }

    .status-approved,
    .status-processed {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .status-rejected {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
    }

    .status-cancelled {
      background: #e5e7eb;
      color: #374151;
    }

    .status-processing {
      background: #dbeafe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(260px, .8fr);
      gap: 17px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .main-column,
    .side-column {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e5eaf1;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 19px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(16, 24, 40, .035);
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      letter-spacing: -.2px;
    }

    .course-title {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .course-code {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #047857;
      border-radius: 7px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 750;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .info-item {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .info-label {
      display: block;
      color: #7b8494;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .45px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .info-value {
      color: #263244;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 650;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .reason-box {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #edf0f5;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 13px;
      color: #475467;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .review {
      border: 1px solid #e8edf3;
      border-radius: 11px;
      padding: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .review:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .review-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .review-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .decision {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .decision-approved,
    .decision-recommended,
    .decision-cleared {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .decision-rejected,
    .decision-not_recommended {
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
    }

    .decision-pending,
    .decision-more_info,
    .decision-outstanding_balance {
      background: #fff7e6;
      color: #a15c00;
    }

    .review-comment {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 7px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .review-meta {
      color: #98a2b3;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 7px;
    }

    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 23px;
    }

    .timeline::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 6px;
      top: 7px;
      bottom: 7px;
      width: 2px;
      background: #e4e9ef;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      padding: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .timeline-item:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .timeline-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -22px;
      top: 3px;
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #10b981;
      border: 2px solid #d1fae5;
    }

    .timeline-dot.pending {
      background: #cbd5e1;
      border-color: #f1f5f9;
    }

    .timeline-title {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 750;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .timeline-date {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #98a2b3;
    }

    .timeline-note {
      color: #667085;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .summary-box {
      background: #f0fdf7;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 11px;
      padding: 13px;
    }

    .summary-box strong {
      display: block;
      color: #166534;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .summary-box p {
      color: #476454;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .warning-box {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border: 1px solid #fde68a;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
      color: #854d0e;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .attachment-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #047857;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .attachment-link:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .empty {
      color: #98a2b3;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #98a2b3;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 20px 0 5px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .container {
        width: 94%;
        margin-top: 17px;
      }

      .layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .page-heading h1 {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 15px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .topbar {
        padding: 11px 13px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .dashboard-btn {
        padding: 8px 9px;
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .page-heading {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .info-grid {
        gap: 12px 9px;
      }

      .course-title {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .review-top {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<%
  const withdrawal = typeof request !== 'undefined' && request ? request : {};
  const currentStatus = String(withdrawal.status || 'submitted').toLowerCase();
  const statusLabel = currentStatus.replace(/_/g, ' ');
  const studentName = withdrawal.student_name || withdrawal.full_name || 'Student';
  const courseName = withdrawal.course_name || withdrawal.course_title || 'Course information unavailable';
  const courseCode = withdrawal.course_code || 'N/A';
  const requestId = withdrawal.id || 'N/A';

  const dateValue = (value) => {
    if (!value) return 'Not recorded';
    const date = new Date(value);
    return Number.isNaN(date.getTime()) ? value : date.toLocaleString();
  };

  const displayDecision = (value) => {
    if (!value) return 'Pending';
    return String(value).replace(/_/g, ' ');
  };

  const decisionClass = (value) => {
    const v = String(value || 'pending').toLowerCase();
    return 'decision-' + v.replace(/[^a-z0-9_-]/g, '');
  };
%>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">LuxMind SIS</div>
  <a href="/dashboard" class="dashboard-btn">← Dashboard</a>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <div class="page-heading">
    <div>
      <h1>Withdrawal Request Details</h1>
      <p class="muted">Review the request information, approval stages and processing history.</p>
    </div>

    <span class="status status-<%= currentStatus.replace(/[^a-z0-9_-]/g, '') %>">
      <%= statusLabel %>
    </span>
  </div>

  <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
    <div class="warning-box" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
      <%= error %>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="layout">

    <div class="main-column">

      <!-- COURSE INFORMATION -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Course Information</h2>

        <div class="course-title"><%= courseName %></div>
        <span class="course-code"><%= courseCode %></span>

        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Request Number</span>
            <span class="info-value">#<%= requestId %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Credit Hours</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.credit_hours ?? 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Department</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.department_name || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Semester</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.semester || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Academic Year</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.academic_year || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Submission Date</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.created_at) %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- STUDENT INFORMATION -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Student Information</h2>

        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Student Name</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= studentName %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Student Number</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.student_number || withdrawal.student_id || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.student_email || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Programme</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.programme || withdrawal.program_name || 'N/A' %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WITHDRAWAL REASON -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Student's Withdrawal Reason</h2>

        <div class="reason-box"><%= withdrawal.reason || 'No reason was provided.' %></div>

        <% if (withdrawal.attachment_url) { %>
          <a class="attachment-link"
             href="<%= withdrawal.attachment_url %>"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer">
            View supporting attachment ↗
          </a>
        <% } %>
      </section>

      <!-- REVIEW DECISIONS -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Review and Approval Record</h2>

        <div class="review">
          <div class="review-top">
            <span class="review-title">1. Academic Advisor</span>
            <span class="decision <%= decisionClass(withdrawal.advisor_decision) %>">
              <%= displayDecision(withdrawal.advisor_decision) %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="review-comment">
            <%= withdrawal.advisor_comments || 'No advisor comments recorded.' %>
          </p>
          <div class="review-meta">
            Reviewer: <%= withdrawal.advisor_name || 'Not assigned / not recorded' %>
            · <%= dateValue(withdrawal.advisor_reviewed_at) %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="review">
          <div class="review-top">
            <span class="review-title">2. Head of Department</span>
            <span class="decision <%= decisionClass(withdrawal.hod_decision) %>">
              <%= displayDecision(withdrawal.hod_decision) %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="review-comment">
            <%= withdrawal.hod_comments || 'No HOD comments recorded.' %>
          </p>
          <div class="review-meta">
            Reviewer: <%= withdrawal.hod_name || 'Not assigned / not recorded' %>
            · <%= dateValue(withdrawal.hod_reviewed_at) %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="review">
          <div class="review-top">
            <span class="review-title">3. Finance Office</span>
            <span class="decision <%= decisionClass(withdrawal.finance_decision) %>">
              <%= displayDecision(withdrawal.finance_decision) %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="review-comment">
            <%= withdrawal.finance_comments || 'No financial review recorded. Finance review may not be required for every request.' %>
          </p>
          <div class="review-meta">
            Outstanding balance:
            <%= withdrawal.outstanding_balance != null ? withdrawal.outstanding_balance : 'Not recorded' %>
            · <%= dateValue(withdrawal.finance_reviewed_at) %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="review">
          <div class="review-top">
            <span class="review-title">4. Registrar</span>
            <span class="decision <%= decisionClass(withdrawal.registrar_decision) %>">
              <%= displayDecision(withdrawal.registrar_decision) %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="review-comment">
            <%= withdrawal.registrar_comments || 'No Registrar decision recorded.' %>
          </p>
          <div class="review-meta">
            Registrar: <%= withdrawal.registrar_name || 'Not recorded' %>
            · <%= dateValue(withdrawal.registrar_decided_at) %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PROCESSING RECORD -->
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Official Withdrawal Processing</h2>

        <% if (currentStatus === 'processed') { %>
          <div class="summary-box">
            <strong>Withdrawal processed</strong>
            <p>
              The Registrar has recorded this request as processed.
              The official registration update should be verified in the connected
              Course Registration module.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="info-grid" style="margin-top:15px;">
            <div class="info-item">
              <span class="info-label">Effective Date</span>
              <span class="info-value"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.effective_date) %></span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-item">
              <span class="info-label">Processed Date</span>
              <span class="info-value"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.processed_at) %></span>
            </div>

            <div class="info-item">
              <span class="info-label">Processed By</span>
              <span class="info-value"><%= withdrawal.processed_by_name || withdrawal.registrar_name || 'Not recorded' %></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <% if (withdrawal.processing_notes) { %>
            <div class="reason-box" style="margin-top:13px;"><%= withdrawal.processing_notes %></div>
          <% } %>
        <% } else if (currentStatus === 'approved' || currentStatus === 'processing') { %>
          <div class="warning-box">
            The request has been approved, but official withdrawal processing is not yet confirmed.
            The course should remain in the student's active registration until processing is completed.
          </div>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="empty">
            Official processing details will appear here after the Registrar completes the withdrawal.
          </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="warning-box" style="margin-top:14px;">
          <strong>Registration history must be preserved.</strong>
          Processing a withdrawal must update the student's enrollment status.
          It must not delete the original registration record or remove the course from other students' timetables.
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <aside class="side-column">

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Request Summary</h2>

        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Current Status</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= statusLabel %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Request ID</span>
            <span class="info-value">#<%= requestId %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Created</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.created_at) %></span>
          </div>

          <div class="info-item">
            <span class="info-label">Last Updated</span>
            <span class="info-value"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.updated_at) %></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Workflow Progress</h2>

        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">Request Submitted</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= dateValue(withdrawal.created_at) %></div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot <%= withdrawal.advisor_decision ? '' : 'pending' %>"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">Academic Advisor Review</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= displayDecision(withdrawal.advisor_decision) %></div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot <%= withdrawal.hod_decision ? '' : 'pending' %>"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">HOD Review</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= displayDecision(withdrawal.hod_decision) %></div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot <%= withdrawal.finance_decision ? '' : 'pending' %>"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">Finance Review</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= displayDecision(withdrawal.finance_decision) %></div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot <%= withdrawal.registrar_decision ? '' : 'pending' %>"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">Registrar Decision</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= displayDecision(withdrawal.registrar_decision) %></div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot <%= currentStatus === 'processed' ? '' : 'pending' %>"></span>
            <div class="timeline-title">Official Processing</div>
            <div class="timeline-date"><%= currentStatus === 'processed' ? dateValue(withdrawal.processed_at) : 'Not yet processed' %></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>Important Information</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          A recommendation from the Advisor or HOD is not the final withdrawal decision.
          Finance provides financial clearance when applicable.
          The Registrar is responsible for the final decision and official processing.
        </p>
      </section>

    </aside>

  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    LuxMind SIS · Student Information System
  </div>

</main>

</body>
</html>
